  "description": "\"Yeseo, you can't beat me. Because you aren't as crazy as I am.\"     \n\nTo pay back the 10 billion won her father stole and disappeared with, Yeseo becomes collateral for a terrifying man, Do Kang-hyun.    \n\n\"Well then, Ms. Jin Yeseo. May I have you now?\"   \n \n\"You’re going to do whatever you want anyway, so does my answer even matter?\" \n\nKnowing that this cruel man, who only knows how to possess, could never return her love, she barely manages to hold onto her heart and denies her growing feelings. \n\n\"I won't give you even as much attention as I would to a passing bug, Director.\" \n\nHowever, faced with Kang-hyun’s barbaric and wild obsession, Yeseo eventually admits it. \n\n\"My heart hurts... so please, Director... please...\"    \n\n\"Yeseo, you can't beat me. Because you aren't as crazy as I am.\" \n\nEven if that choice means falling together into the abyss led by Do Kang-hyun.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14419308)",
